ees"]=true}},{["index"]=337,["id"]="0xF625724C",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Schema Laid Bare",["description"]="This cape depicts the inner workings of a medical device submitted to the Ministry of Science 70 years ago, and is bound to clear their patent approval process any day now.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Schema Laid Bare",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=338,["id"]="0xB545A9BF",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Badge of Order",["description"]="This sigil reaffirms the Helldiver's pledge to protect Managed Democracy, serve Managed Democracy, and uphold Managed Democracy.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Badge of Order",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=339,["id"]="0xF511B688",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Eternal Corona",["description"]="Featuring an ancient sun symbol and a distressed look, this cape reminds us that the light of Liberty is everlasting, and will keep shining even when we ourselves have become tattered and frayed.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Eternal Corona",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=340,["id"]="0x5EB11243",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common"},{["index"]=341,["id"]="0xEF4FA522",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Scraps of Sovereignty",["description"]="Composed of reclaimed industrial mesh and salvaged banners. This cape celebrates the beauty found in the aftermath of purging Tyranny at high-speeds. The debris of these successes, and those like it, remind us all of the sanctity of Sovereignty."},{["index"]=342,["id"]="0x10FD9607",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="De-Forester's Sailcloth",["description"]="This convenient cape can double as ground insulation, warming blanket, or camp roofing to the enterprising defoliator.",["wiki"]={["name"]="De-Forester's Sailcloth",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=343,["id"]="0xA7945016",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Diagram of the Noblest Payload",["description"]="Rendering the Helldiver's descent to the battlefield in splendorous foil, this cape illustrates that in any successful military machinery, heroic humans are the most vital piece.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Diagram of the Noblest Payload",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=344,["id"]="0xD3E885CE",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Gilded Quill",["description"]="The golden, piercing quills symbolize the deadly and poetic Justice delivered to seditious oppositionists. Silent sanctions, delivered with unerring precision and incontestable deniability.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Gilded Quill",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=345,["id"]="0x1A0297E0",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Tread of Liberty",["description"]="The striking dorsal tread pattern represents the unstoppable, grinding, and uniform march of Managed Democracy. It boldly assures all onlookers that resistance is not merely futile, but also logistically inefficient and statistically disastrous.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Tread of Liberty",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=346,["id"]="0xB46BA4F4",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Testament to Attrition",["description"]="Salvaged from a deep-storage vault, this well-ventilated cape symbolizes tenacious survival. Its visible scars bestow immediate veteran status, reminding all onlookers that the spirit of tireless service is immortal.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Testament to Attrition",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=347,["id"]="0x14712621",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Standard of Safe Distance",["description"]="By reminding Chemical Agents of proper distancing rules, this extraordinary innovation in cape design ensures that they never cause another unfortunate outbreak of Carcino-Plague.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Standard of Safe Distance",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=348,["id"]="0xFC920AE4",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Patient Zero's Rememberance",["description"]="With this cape we honor the bio-warfare pioneers of Division Zero, conscripted from quarantine zones and hospices to spread their Carcino-Plague on the battlefield.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Patient Zero's Remembrance",["match"]="fuzzy",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=349,["id"]="0x43265392",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Pride of the Whistleblower",["description"]="Granted to the Truth Enforcers' Informant of the Month, this tasteful cape conjures images of dissident blood on asphalt.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Pride of the Whistleblower",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=350,["id"]="0xEC5C680E",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Proof of Faultless Virtue",["description"]="This cape signifies that its wearer thinks, feels, and acts correctly at all times, and thus bears the responsibility to educate and re-educate their fellow citizen.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Proof of Faultless Virtue",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=351,["id"]="0xD1C109DE",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Greatcloak of Rebar Resolve",["description"]="Inside the collar is embroidered: \"Wherever I may plant my shield, know that I will never yield,\" and \"machine washable.\"",["wiki"]={["name"]="Rebar Resolve",["match"]="contained",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=352,["id"]="0xF89E3F1E",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Holder of the Yellow Line",["description"]="Since ancient times, the yellow line has symbolized an uncrossable boundary. To don this cape is to draw that line between tyranny and liberty, between alien monstrosities and Super Earth property, and never yield the right of way.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Holder of the Yellow Line",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=353,["id"]="0x391BC756",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Fre Liberam",["description"]="Each purchase of this cape comes with a complimentary will and testament amendment form, which guarantees the soon-to-be-deceased a prominent spot on the Wall of Martyrs.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Fre Liberam",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=354,["id"]="0x08CBB74B",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Per Democrasum",["description"]="This cape honors the Eagle pilots who would follow a Stratagem beacon into the very jaws of tyranny, even when the beacon's placement seems inscrutable to the non-Helldiver mind.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Per Democrasum",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=355,["id"]="0xBCA406F6",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Reaper of Bounties",["description"]="This cape recalls the popular folk tale of the \"Freedomslingers\": re-educated dissidents, seeking redemption on the Federation's Borderline, hunting dangerous thought-traitors in exchange for ballot bounties. ",["wiki"]={["name"]="Reaper of Bounties",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=356,["id"]="0x3A28A2E7",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Way of the Bandolier",["description"]="The dauntless pioneers of the Great Expansion, facing the un-Democratic unknown, adopted the Way of the Bandolier. With the gusto of their covering fire making up for their modest accuracy, they strived to be perfectly aligned in their shared values, and ready to serve when called upon by the machine gun of civic duty.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Way of the Bandolier",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=357,["id"]="0x1B3BD8A1",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Federation's Embrace",["description"]="When donning the One True Flag, one must face the direction of Super Earth, recite the Super Earth Anthem, and salute one's own image in the nearest reflective surface. Wrongful discarding of this cape is a capital offense.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Federation's Embrace",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=358,["id"]="0x55D5144B",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Humble Regalia",["description"]="This modest cape has been worn by those guarding the Chamber of Unanimous Decision since time immemorial.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Humble Regalia",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=359,["id"]="0xEBB26E73",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Conductor of Brilliance",["description"]="The embroidered pattern uses aluminium from Automaton motherboards, granting the once-wretched metals a new and noble purpose.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Conductor of Brilliance",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=360,["id"]="0x1674440A",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Over Artifice Triumphant",["description"]="Humanity's intellect shines brighter than all other, piercing even the treacherous darkness that spawned the Automatons' pseudo-sentience; the darkness known as computer science.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Over Artifice Triumphant",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=361,["id"]="0x4470F6FF",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["dlc"]="0x4470F6FF",["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Miranda's Legacy",["description"]="Although Super Citizen Miranda's true identity has been lost to time, most legal historians agree that she was once a patron of highly-efficient interrogation techniques.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Miranda's Legacy",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=362,["id"]="0x3BF70DE7",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["dlc"]="0x3BF70DE7",["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Mother Eagle's Wings",["description"]="Those taken under the wings of the Law can rest easy knowing that their transgressions will soon be laid bare, their harms amended, and their citizenship safely sequestered.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Mother Eagle's Wings",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=363,["id"]="0x30D1157A",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["dlc"]="0x30D1157A",["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Rightful Occupier",["description"]="Painted by visionary artist Silas Garm during an intense fever, this symbol represents Humanity's great Galactic endeavor: the blood-soaked dawn of Lasting Peace.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Rightful Occupier",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=364,["id"]="0x7EEE690B",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["dlc"]="0x7EEE690B",["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Windswept Wayfinder",["description"]="It is well-documented that soldiers raised on harsh planets have an advantage when fighting in similar environments; this insight is foundational to the Democratic Youth Scouts Exchange Program.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Windswept Wayfinder",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=365,["id"]="0xFF46327A",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Dissident's Nightmare",["description"]="After extensive testing in Patriotic Rehabilitation Centers, this design was proved most terrifying to dissent-afflicted individuals. ",["wiki"]={["name"]="Dissident's Nightmare",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=366,["id"]="0xAB29952A",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Pinions of Everlasting Glory",["description"]="All but ensures ascension to the immortal ranks of those enshrined in the Super Earth Digital Archive of Valorous Acts.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Pinions of Everlasting Glory",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=367,["id"]="0xE8072038",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Order of the Venerated Ballot",["description"]="Adorned with the insignia of the Order of the Venerated Ballot, a Ministry-sanctioned Patriot's Club for citizens who pledge themselves to preserving the sanctity of voting.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Order of the Venerated Ballot",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=368,["id"]="0x9DBD09D7",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="MARK OF THE CRIMSON FANG",["description"]="Marks the most obedient of the obedient, those who will strike headlong at the veins of Tyranny and administer the sweet antidote of Freedom.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Mark of the Crimson Fang",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=369,["id"]="0x115D8156",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="EXECUTIONER'S CANOPY",["description"]="\067\114\101\115\116\115\032\116\104\101\032\115\104\111\117\108\100\101\114\115\032\111\102\032\116\104\111\115\101\032\119\104\111\032\100\101\108\105\118\101\114\032\116\104\101\032\102\105\110\097\108\226\128\148\097\110\100\032\109\111\115\116\032\105\110\100\105\115\112\101\110\115\097\098\108\101\226\128\148\115\116\114\111\107\101\032\111\102\032\074\117\115\116\105\099\101\046",["wiki"]={["name"]="Executioner's Canopy",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=370,["id"]="0x099116E7",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="PURIFYING ECLIPSE",["description"]="A tribute to the Liberation of Choepessa IV in the First Galactic War, in which so much orbital ordnance was detonated that its sun was occluded by ash for an entire lunar cycle.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Purifying Eclipse",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=371,["id"]="0xE67E5867",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="THE BREACH",["description"]="As documented in the bestselling graphic novel \"The Breach,\" the final mission of the 361st \"Freedom's Flame\" saw the storied unit deploy straight into the heart of a Supervolcano, sacrificing themselves to trigger an eruption and wipe out a massive Terminid swarm.",["wiki"]={["name"]="The Breach",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=372,["id"]="0xBED85953",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Vector of Victory",["description"]="\065\032\115\121\109\098\111\108\032\111\102\032\116\104\101\032\099\111\110\115\116\097\110\116\044\032\102\111\114\119\097\114\100\045\109\111\118\105\110\103\032\112\114\111\112\117\108\115\105\118\101\032\102\111\114\099\101\032\111\102\032\077\097\110\097\103\101\100\032\068\101\109\111\099\114\097\099\121\046\032\084\104\105\115\032\099\097\112\101\032\104\111\110\111\114\115\032\116\104\111\115\101\032\119\104\111\032\117\110\100\101\114\115\116\097\110\100\032\116\104\097\116\032\105\110\032\116\104\101\032\114\097\099\101\032\102\111\114\032\070\114\101\101\100\111\109\044\032\116\104\101\114\101\032\097\114\101\032\110\111\032\098\114\097\107\101\115\226\128\148\111\110\108\121\032\100\101\103\114\101\101\115\032\111\102\032\109\111\109\101\110\116\117\109\046"},{["index"]=373,["id"]="0x144C1D6F",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="PODIUM OF PROSPERITY",["description"]="Featuring a vibrant, high-visibility pattern to signify the inevitable victory of the Federation. This cape reminds all observers that while the road to Liberty is paved with sacrifice, the \"podium\" at the end is reserved exclusively for the compliant."},{["index"]=374,["id"]="0x38068BEB",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Strength in Our Arms",["description"]="The symbol on this cape represents the pillars of freedom: duty, obedience, and loyalty.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Strength in Our Arms",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=375,["id"]="0x4260B28C",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Defender of Our Dream",["description"]="Commemorating the New Stockholm treaty on prisoners of war, this cape celebrates the right of all enemy combatants to a swift and merciful execution.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Defender of Our Dream",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=376,["id"]="0xF35ECA5B",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Mark of the Constrictor",["description"]="Marks the most Free of the Free, those who will seize tyranny by the neck and squeeze until no oppression remains.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Mark of the Constrictor",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=377,["id"]="0x64D8BA07",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Foe Rent Asunder",["description"]="This ancient, likely allegorical, illustration of Might triumphing over the Anguiform is seen by scholars as a symbol of humankind's supremacy in the art of violence.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Foe Rent Asunder",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=378,["id"]="0x86CA918C",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Free-Spirited Spangles",["description"]="A tribute to the mischief-makers and mavericks, those trailblazers who dutifully execute their orders with universally-endearing panache. The star-crossed trail calls to mind the special kind of Freedom that can only be achieved by going very fast in very expensive state-owned vehicles.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Free-Spirited Spangles",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=379,["id"]="0xBA9E281B",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Watchful Compatriot",["description"]="This cape's retro print, first made popular in GW1 cereal merchandising, helps children remember that not all machines are twisted mechano-socialists; some are piloted by true-hearted humans, and we can all rest easy in their gaze.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Watchful Compatriot",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=380,["id"]="0x52F858A8",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Honored Heirloom",["description"]="Should the wearer of this cape perish at the hands of Freedom's enemies, it is customary to pass the cape on to their bravest child during the funeral, inspiring the next generation to take up arms.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Honored Heirloom",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=381,["id"]="0xE4C12748",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Eye of the Clandestine",["description"]="Those who serve Liberty from the shadows often elect to stay anonymous, moving like traceless specters through the night. May they watch over us always.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Eye of the Clandestine",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=382,["id"]="0x724501BE",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="Camo Cloak",["description"]="The horrors of Tyranny are manifold, their minions many, but they are naught before Democracy's twin swords: overwhelming firepower, and those trained elite who unquestioningly wield it.",["wiki"]={["name"]="Camo Cloak",["match"]="exact",["passiveAgrees"]=true}},{["index"]=383,["id"]="0x9A42A639",["slot"]="cape",["passive"]=0,["rarity"]="common",["name"]="City Fighter's Resolve",["description"]="\034\084\104\101\032\072\101\108\108\100\105\118\101\114\115\032\097\114\101\032\097\108\108\032\116\104\097\116\032\115\116\097\110\100\032\098\101\116\119\101\101\110\032\068\101\109\111\099\114\097\099\121\032\097\110\100\032\116\104\101\032\070\097\115\099\105\115\116\032\104\111\114\100\101\115\046\032\084\114\097\105\110\101\100\032\115\105\110\099\101\032\098\105\114\116\104\032\105\110\032\116\104\101\032\097\114\116\032\111\102\032\068\101\102\101\110\115\105\118\101\032\087\097\114\102\097\114\101\044\032\116\104\101\121\032\109\101\101\116\032\109\105\110\100\108\101\115\115\032\108\101\103\105\111\110\115\032\119\105\116\104\032\116\104\101\032\115\116\101\097\100\121\032\097\105\109\032\111\102\032\111\110\101\032\119\104\111\032\104\097\115\032\115\101\101\110\032\099\111\117\110\116\108\101\115\115\032\098\097\116\116\108\101\115\046\034\032\226\128\148\069\120\099\101\114\112\116\032\102\114\111\109\032\116\104\101\032\106\111\117\114\110\097\108\032\111\102\032\097\032\067\104\097\114\097\110\032\068\101\109\111\099\114\097\099\121\032\079\102\102\105\099\101\114\044\032\099\097\046\032\